===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{term|usser|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|ussier|lang=fro}}, {{term|uissier||porter, doorman|lang=fro}} (compare French {{term|huissier|lang=fr}}), from {{etyl|VL.|en}} *{{term||ustiārius|doorkeeper|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|ōstiārius|lang=la}}, from  {{term|ostium||door|lang=la}}. Akin to {{term|ōs||mouth|lang=la}}.

